==Walking Pokémon effects==
When interacting with [[walking Pokémon]] in {{v2|HeartGold and SoulSilver|s}}, the Pokémon may occasionally show an altered mood specific to this location.
*{{type|Ice}} Pokémon become happy that it's become a bit cold.
*Non-{{type|Ice}} walking Pokémon become angry that they feel a bit cold and sometimes bump into the {{player}}.

